              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">BowFlex 552 (5–52.5 lb) and 1090 (10–90 lb), recalled June 2025</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Model and serial sticker on the bottom of the plastic tray; the notice lists the affected serial ranges</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">2004 to May 2025</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Amazon Basics 55 Lbs. Adjustable Dumbbells, recalled May 2026</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Lot code C250306VJAW5 on the outer cardboard box</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">July to September 2025, Amazon</td></tr>
